# sweep: --bare
# A source chosen before the first refresh is the list the brief comes from,
# and the time it came reads as a time of day.
wait-for Nothing yet
tap Source
wait-for All four are public Hacker News lists
expect Top stories
expect Ask Hacker News
tap-id source-show
wait-idle
tap Brief
wait-for Show Hacker News selected. Refresh to fetch it.
clean
shot source-chosen
tap Refresh
wait-idle 60000
wait-for Show Hacker News · as of
expect Ready offline:
clean
shot brief-show
restart
wait-for Show Hacker News · as of
tap Source
wait-for All four are public Hacker News lists
clean
shot sources-after-restart
tap Brief
wait-for Daily brief
expect-missing as of 20
